      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>I don't think writing things down is gonna help. There's nothing to write about. It's not just that I'm bored or need a new hobby, it's that the \"me\" that used to care about things is just... gone. I wake up and I'm just performing these motions. I go to work, I eat, I sleep, but I'm not really there. It feels like I'm just a hollow shell waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. It's just exhausting to keep pretending to be a person.",
